q: title: Will a balloon deflate during the 2025 Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade?, description: This market will resolve to "Yes" if any balloon featured in the 2025 Macy's Thanksgiving Day Parade (https://www.macys.com/s/parade/lineup/) visibly deflates during the parade broadcast on November 27, 2025. Otherwise, this market will resolve to "No".

A balloon will be considered "deflated" if it significantly loses air, resulting in a notable change in its shape, size, or ability to float as intended. Minor leaks or damage that do not visibly alter the balloon's appearance or functionality will not count.

The resolution source will be the official NBC broadcast of the parade. market_id: 706278 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to No, p2 to Yes, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x65070BE91477460D8A7AeEb94ef92fe056C2f2A7 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:65070be91477460d8a7aeeb94ef92fe056c2f2a7